# Generated Tokyo traffic-simulation datasets. Keep only directory skeletons;
# reviewed final artifacts belong in 06_outputs/traffic_simulation/.
03_data/processed/traffic_simulation/**
!03_data/processed/traffic_simulation/**/
!03_data/processed/traffic_simulation/README.md
!03_data/processed/traffic_simulation/**/.gitkeep

# Third-party source material is fetched locally; version only registries and
# directory documentation.  Keep the traffic-simulation skeleton so every
# environment uses the same source-specific paths without tracking downloads.
03_data/raw/**
!03_data/raw/traffic_simulation/
!03_data/raw/traffic_simulation/README.md
!03_data/raw/traffic_simulation/**/
!03_data/raw/traffic_simulation/**/.gitkeep
02_literature/references/pdf_derived/pdfs/*
!02_literature/references/pdf_derived/pdfs/.gitkeep
02_literature/references/pdf_derived/text/
*.zip
*.pdf

